messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 534555 and 462889? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo solve the problem of finding the sum of 534555 and 462889, we can follow these steps:.\n1. Align the numbers by their place values, making sure the digits in the same place value are in the same column.\n2. Add the digits starting from the rightmost column (the units place) and move to the left.\n3. If the sum of the digits in any column is 10 or more, carry over the extra digit to the next column to the left.\n4. Continue this process until all columns have been added.\nLet's perform the addition:.\n```.\n  534555.\n+ 462889.\n---------.\n```.\nStarting from the rightmost column (units place):.\n5 + 9 = 14. Write down 4 and carry over 1.\n```.\n  534555.\n+ 462889.\n---------.\n       4.\n```.\nNext column (tens place):.\n5 + 8 + 1 (carried over) = 14. Write down 4 and carry over 1.\n```.\n  534555.\n+ 462889.\n---------.\n      44.\n```.\nNext column (hundreds place):.\n5 + 2 + 1 (carried over) = 8.\n```.\n  534555.\n+ 462889.\n---------.\n     844.\n```.\nNext column (thousands place):.\n4 + 8 = 12. Write down 2 and carry over 1.\n```.\n  534555.\n+ 462889.\n---------.\n    2844.\n```.\nNext column (ten thousands place):.\n3 + 6 + 1 (carried over) = 10. Write down 0 and carry over 1.\n```.\n  534555.\n+ 462889.\n---------.\n   02844.\n```.\nNext column (hundred thousands place):.\n5 + 4 = 9.\n```.\n  534555.\n+ 462889.\n---------.\n  997444.\n```.\nSo, the sum of 534555 and 462889 is 997444.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
