messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 248413 and 961457? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo solve the problem of finding the sum of 248413 and 961457, we can follow these steps:.\n1. Align the numbers by their place values, making sure the digits in the same place value are in the same column.\n2. Add the digits starting from the rightmost column (units place) and move to the left.\n3. If the sum of digits in any column is 10 or more, carry over the tens digit to the next column to the left.\n4. Continue this process until all columns have been added.\n5. The final result will be the sum of the two numbers.\n</think>.\n<answer>.\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n```.\n  248413.\n+ 961457.\n---------.\n```.\nStarting from the rightmost column (units place):.\n3 + 7 = 10. Write down 0 and carry over 1.\n```.\n  248413.\n+ 961457.\n---------.\n      0.\n```.\nNext column (tens place):.\n1 + 5 + 1 (carried over) = 7. Write down 7.\n```.\n  248413.\n+ 961457.\n---------.\n     70.\n```.\nNext column (hundreds place):.\n4 + 4 + 0 (no carry) = 8. Write down 8.\n```.\n  248413.\n+ 961457.\n---------.\n    870.\n```.\nNext column (thousands place):.\n8 + 1 + 0 (no carry) = 9. Write down 9.\n```.\n  248413.\n+ 961457.\n---------.\n   9870.\n```.\nNext column (ten thousands place):.\n4 + 6 + 0 (no carry) = 10. Write down 0 and carry over 1.\n```.\n  248413.\n+ 961457.\n---------.\n  09870.\n```.\nNext column (hundred thousands place):.\n2 + 9 + 1 (carried over) = 12. Write down 2 and carry over 1.\n```.\n  248413.\n+ 961457.\n---------. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
